{"id":"H0031","lemma":"אֲבִיהוּד","transliteration":"avihud","sayIt":"a-vi-hud","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Abihud","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1Ch.8.3;\nson of: Bela (H1106A);\nbrother of: Ard (H0714H), Naaman (H5283H), Ezbon (H0675H), Uzzi (H5813I), Uzziel (H5816I), Jerimoth (H3406), Iri (H5901), Addar (H0146H), Gera (H1617I), Abishua (H0050H) and Ahoah (H0265)\n§ Abihud = \"my father is majesty\"\nson of Bela, a Benjamite","glosses":["abihud"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"Abihud","kjv":"and Abihud"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:3","note":"Bela had sons: Addar, Gera, Abihud,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1106","lemma":"בֶּ֫לַע","transliteration":"bela","gloss":"Bela"},{"id":"H0714","lemma":"אַרְדְּ","transliteration":"ard","gloss":"Ard"},{"id":"H5283","lemma":"נַעֲמָן","transliteration":"naaman","gloss":"Naaman"},{"id":"H0675","lemma":"אֶצְבּוֹן","transliteration":"etsbon","gloss":"Ezbon"},{"id":"H5813","lemma":"עֻזִּי","transliteration":"uzzi","gloss":"Uzzi"},{"id":"H5816","lemma":"עֻזִּיאֵל","transliteration":"uzziel","gloss":"Uzziel"},{"id":"H3406","lemma":"יְרִימוֹת","transliteration":"yerimot","gloss":"Jerimoth"},{"id":"H5901","lemma":"עִירִי","transliteration":"iri","gloss":"Iri"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}